Don't panic!
Conflicts during commits are normal and this failure is intended to resolve the conflicts.
Conflicts are mainly caused by the following scenarios:
1. Multiple jobs are writing into the same partition at the same time, or you use STATEMENT SET to execute multiple INSERT statements into the same Paimon table.
